# 2. MICROSOFT ONEDRIVE / GRAPH API (Brochures & Storage)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Azure Portal App Registration -> API Permissions: Files.ReadWrite, Files.ReadWrite.All
# Acquired via OAuth2 Bearer Token for uploading directly into dedicated website folder
